ber \\(2000000000000\\) has a rightmost non-zero digit of \\(2\\) and is followed by 12 zeros. Therefore, the ordered pair \\((a, b)\\) is:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{(2, 12)}\n\\]"},"grade":{"answer":"\\boxed{(2, 12)}","correct":true,"format":"boxed","parseable":true}}
